      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-04-05T05:49:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it correct to unconditionally transition to this state regardless of what state we\u0027re in now? What if we\u0027re in CaptivePortalState, or if we\u0027ve not done the captive portal probes yet?",
