      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-04-05T06:41:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Most substates of MaybeNotifyState eat this message and do nothing with it.\n\nEvaluatingPrivateDnsState will handle it as well.\n\nThis is just here for ValidatedState.  I moved it over there; hope that\u0027s more clear.",
      "parentUuid": "fa1d04f9_f6da3fea",
